OL,3,GNEWSAFly-tippers face #5k fine in new
OL,4,Acrackdown
OL,5,
OL,6,FFly-tippers in Cornwall could face
OL,7,Ffines of up to #5,000 if they are
OL,8,Fcaught illegally disposing waste.
OL,10,FThe threat is a part of Cornwall
OL,11,FCouncil's new push to quash the crime
OL,12,Fafter it recorded 17,500 fly-tipping
OL,13,Fincidents in the past five years.
OL,15,FIt has introduced the use of covert
OL,16,Fcameras to catch unlicensed waste
OL,17,Fcarriers in the act, and is also
OL,18,Fencouraging residents to submit
OL,19,Fevidence if they catch anything on
OL,20,Fcamera. Households who are found to
OL,21,Fhave employed fly-tippers also face
OL,22,Ffines.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,345,340,200,160,0,100
