OL,3,GNEWSAFly-tippers face #5k fine in new
OL,4,Acrackdown
OL,5,
OL,6,FCornwall Council said there was "no
OL,7,Fexcuse" for the offence, and that it
OL,8,Fwould hold fly-tippers to account.
